WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 line:0% align:end size:15%
<ruby><rt>kaa.lt</rt></ruby>

1
00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:06.650
Within a clover's fourth 
leaf dwells good luck.

2
00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:09.590
Within a fifth leaf...

3
00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:11.400
resides a devil.

4
00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:15.080
The Clover Kingdom.

5
00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:17.420
In this kingdom where magic is everything,

6
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:19.320
there is one boy who can't use magic.

7
00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:20.450
His name is Asta.

8
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:25.370
He puts in blood, sweat, and tears 
in hopes of becoming the Wizard King.

9
00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:31.610
One day, Asta obtained the power of 
anti-magic, which nullifies all magic.

10
00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:36.170
Meanwhile, the Dark Triad,
the rulers of the Spade Kingdom,

11
00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:39.110
also possessed the powers of 
the devils from the underworld,

12
00:00:39.110 --> 00:00:41.930
and began invading the other kingdoms.

13
00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:44.690
After a fierce battle, 
Asta and his friends

14
00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:47.520
defeated Dante, one of the Dark Triad,

15
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:50.840
but then Magic Knight Squad 
Captains Yami and Vangeance,

16
00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:53.570
along with Queen Loropechika, 
were kidnapped.

17
00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:55.610
In order to get them back,

18
00:00:55.610 --> 00:00:58.850
Asta tries to obtain the 
true powers of the devil.

19
00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:03.860
The Clover Kingdom's counterattack 
is about to begin.

20
00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:16.800
Spade Kingdom

21
00:01:53.230 --> 00:01:56.470
My brother had better be doing well...

22
00:01:58.020 --> 00:01:59.390
Morris.

23
00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:05.570
I played a key role in the 
Diamond Kingdom's sorcery studies.

24
00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:09.480
I'll heal him right up with no problems.

25
00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:12.740
He'll be even stronger than before.

26
00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:14.820
The magic necessary for

27
00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:17.990
the ritual of the advent is being 
collected by the Candelo I created.

28
00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:20.740
I wish you'd trust me a bit more.

29
00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:24.250
I was chased out of the kingdom 
because of that traitor Mars,

30
00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:27.080
but I ended up in a far 
more interesting place.

31
00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.750
I thank all of you.

32
00:02:34.470 --> 00:02:39.400
Ah... I'm looking forward to 
fighting that little brat again.

33
00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:42.520
No slip-ups with the other preparations?

34
00:02:42.520 --> 00:02:44.540
Everything's going pretty well.

35
00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:46.790
Isn't that right, Lotus?

36
00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:47.810
Yes.

37
00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:52.940
Well... this seems like a big mess.

38
00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:57.400
Clover Castle

39
00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:05.530
The Tree of Qliphoth, which connects 
this world to the underworld...

40
00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:10.170
In order to create it, 
they need Yami and Vangeance.

41
00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:13.530
In three days, the gate to the 
underworld will be opened.

42
00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:17.340
Before that happens, we're going 
to take back Yami and Vangeance

43
00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:19.680
and destroy the Tree of Qliphoth.

44
00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:22.600
This time, we'll be the ones who attack.

45
00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:27.610
I'm the Wizard King, and yet... 
I'm powerless at a time like this.

46
00:03:33.550 --> 00:03:35.440
You chose what was right.

47
00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:39.450
But that doesn't mean people who 
are right will always be rewarded.

48
00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.280
We're up!

49
00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:44.950
So you need to get stronger,

50
00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:49.960
to keep yourself from 
losing to unjust evil.

51
00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:01.720
Devil Union Mode: Canis.

52
00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:07.230
Now we begin your real 
so-called "training."

53
00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:09.160
Both of you together...

54
00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:13.260
Try and defeat me.

55
00:05:38.540 --> 00:05:43.990
The Battle Begins

56
00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:51.640
Asta, the only way you can become stronger

57
00:05:51.640 --> 00:05:56.950
is to unite with that devil and draw out 
100% of the power of that anti-magic.

58
00:06:00.080 --> 00:06:00.960
A tail?

59
00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.850
Huh? Liebe disappeared?

60
00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:15.270
Hey, I'm right here.

61
00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.980
He got all tiny!

62
00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:21.600
Apparently this is what happens 
when I give you my power.

63
00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:23.850
In devil-binding contracts,

64
00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:26.900
control belongs to the 
one giving the orders.

65
00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:29.150
In other words, the human.

66
00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:33.120
That's why I can easily use Union.

67
00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.730
Your current condition isn't Union.

68
00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:38.620
It's just that devil's power 
trickling into you.

69
00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:41.750
You said something similar, too, Liebe!

70
00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.720
How do I use your true powers?

71
00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:45.770
I don't know.

72
00:06:45.770 --> 00:06:46.550
What?!

73
00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:51.240
I was trying to take over 
your body and fight.

74
00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:53.910
This is my first time fighting outside it.

75
00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:56.310
That's why I lost to the likes of you.

76
00:06:56.840 --> 00:07:00.830
You don't know anything! 
And you were all high-and-mighty!

77
00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:03.750
You're the one who formed this 
nonsensical contract with me!

78
00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:04.930
You figure this out!

79
00:07:04.930 --> 00:07:07.020
I have no idea, either!

80
00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:08.530
Clearly...

81
00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:11.550
you're going to have to figure 
that out as you fight.

82
00:07:13.440 --> 00:07:15.390
When I use Union,

83
00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:18.830
I can add the characteristics of each 
of my devils to my shadow magic.

84
00:07:19.350 --> 00:07:21.470
One of Gimodelo's characteristics is...

85
00:07:22.820 --> 00:07:23.930
Pack.

86
00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:37.790
Each of these guys has the 
same ki as Vice Captain Nacht!

87
00:07:39.260 --> 00:07:43.000
The shadows won't disappear 
until you defeat me.

88
00:07:44.680 --> 00:07:48.400
He's fully blended in with them.
I can't tell where he is!

89
00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:53.780
Does this mean Vice Captain Nacht 
has contracts with four devils?!

90
00:07:53.780 --> 00:07:56.820
He's been face-to-face 
with death that often?!

91
00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:58.740
Now that Liebe and I have a contract,

92
00:07:58.740 --> 00:08:01.620
our bond should be even 
stronger than before!

93
00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:04.620
I should be able to draw 
out more of his power!

94
00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:07.670
You formed a contract on 
equal terms with a devil.

95
00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:13.730
Since he's not your servant, of course 
you can't immediately use that power.

96
00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:16.840
You're the one who chose that path.

97
00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:21.720
Try and defeat me with that power.

98
00:08:25.800 --> 00:08:26.480
Yes, sir.

99
00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:33.820
Right here, right now, 
I'm going to surpass my limits.

100
00:08:42.180 --> 00:08:43.330
Demon-Slasher.

101
00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:47.840
Your name is... the Demon-Slasher Katana!

102
00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:50.940
Let's go get Captain Yami together!

103
00:08:50.940 --> 00:08:53.630
By surpassing our limits, 
right here, right now!

104
00:08:54.990 --> 00:08:57.380
I hate that phrase.

105
00:09:03.160 --> 00:09:07.480
Thank you for seeing me 
through my training,

106
00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.450
Former Vice Captain Langris.

107
00:09:09.450 --> 00:09:11.150
The "Former" wasn't necessary.

108
00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:14.650
You're as mean as ever, I see.

109
00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:16.880
Not as mean as you.

110
00:09:16.880 --> 00:09:20.780
By the way, where's your 
yappy little spirit?

111
00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:24.540
Bell won't come out of 
the grimoire right now.

112
00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:27.260
Ugh. How annoying.

113
00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:35.130
To think you can do all this 
without the spirit's power.

114
00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:46.560
You two lost again.

115
00:09:46.820 --> 00:09:50.340
Vice Captain Nacht's super strong...

116
00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:53.140
No matter how many times I challenge 
him, I can't see a way to win.

117
00:09:53.140 --> 00:09:56.250
And yet... he probably 
isn't even serious yet.

118
00:09:56.250 --> 00:09:59.570
So this is the power of Union...

119
00:09:59.950 --> 00:10:03.320
Why can't Liebe and I do the same thing?

120
00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:07.580
Even though when I get hurt in 
my black form, Liebe does, too...

121
00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:15.840
This is so good!

122
00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:18.750
And my wounds and stamina are recovering!

123
00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:22.490
What are the snacks made with the Spade 
Kingdom's resistance's magic called again?

124
00:10:22.490 --> 00:10:24.600
I need to thank them when I see them!

125
00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:27.640
Oh! Eating something 
sweet gave me an idea!

126
00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:29.100
Come with me for a bit, Liebe!

127
00:10:29.870 --> 00:10:33.170
When he gets like this, 
about 10% of the time,

128
00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:35.730
whatever he comes up with is genius...

129
00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:40.810
Combine!

130
00:10:41.150 --> 00:10:44.070
This one definitely goes 
into the 90%, though.

131
00:10:44.070 --> 00:10:47.200
We don't have time to mess 
around, you 90% idiot!

132
00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:49.020
I'm not, though!

133
00:10:49.020 --> 00:10:52.710
If we fight like this, our hearts and 
bodies will become even more as one!

134
00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:56.850
Don't you get tired of being 
such a goody-two-shoes?

135
00:10:57.600 --> 00:11:00.630
Don't you get tired of 
being so free, Big Brother?

136
00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:05.140
You idiot. What's so 
tiring about being free?

137
00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:08.550
If we could become one like this, 
we'd have no problems, you 90% idiot!

138
00:11:08.550 --> 00:11:11.210
What'd you say?! You get to 
be on top, so stop complaining!

139
00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:13.400
It's about time to meet up with the rest.

140
00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:18.400
Huh? It's already been two days?! 
I didn't even notice! Oh, crap!

141
00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:20.080
I guess there's no other choice.

142
00:11:23.350 --> 00:11:26.590
If it's not going to work, 
then just die here.

143
00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:29.950
Liebe!

144
00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:32.960
Mana Zone: Dark Prison Hunting Ground.

145
00:11:37.960 --> 00:11:39.460
It's pitch dark...

146
00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.470
This is...

147
00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:51.310
Their ki... I can't sense anything! 
I have no way of dodging these attacks!

148
00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:55.190
You showed such potential. What a shame.

149
00:11:55.470 --> 00:11:58.940
From darkness where I can't feel 
anything to creeping death...

150
00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:01.940
This is true fear!

151
00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:09.470
Damn it!

152
00:12:09.470 --> 00:12:12.040
Why won't it work when 
we're this cornered?!

153
00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:17.040
Asta and I should both feel the same. 
We both want more power!

154
00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:22.670
So why? Why can't we Unite?!

155
00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:25.930
To save Captain Yami...

156
00:12:26.440 --> 00:12:29.730
To avenge Licita...

157
00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.650
I can't afford to die!

158
00:12:33.650 --> 00:12:34.980
And...

159
00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.970
I can't let him die, either!

160
00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:14.310
He made sure he didn't hit me directly.

161
00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:18.560
He didn't even touch me, but the 
Union in my arm came undone.

162
00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:23.570
He also erased my magic, which has no 
substance, along with the Mana Zone.

163
00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:25.380
Anti-magic...

164
00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:28.030
If he used it at full power, he'd be...

165
00:13:30.380 --> 00:13:31.980
the strongest.

166
00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:33.540
I lose.

167
00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:36.750
Heck yeah! So let's get going, quick!

168
00:13:36.990 --> 00:13:37.850
No.

169
00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:41.630
B-But why?! Liebe and I 
pulled off Devil Union!

170
00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:46.860
Only for a mere second. 
You haven't mastered it yet.

171
00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:51.060
You should know that yourself. Am I wrong?

172
00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:56.020
He's right. But we came this far!

173
00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.550
If you go into enemy 
territory in this state,

174
00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:01.030
you'll only die in the end.

175
00:14:01.030 --> 00:14:01.900
But I—

176
00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:04.150
Using my shadow magic...

177
00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:06.620
I was watching you and 
the other Black Bulls.

178
00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:07.650
What?

179
00:14:07.940 --> 00:14:12.560
You were born without magic, 
accidentally possessed by a devil,

180
00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:15.160
and toyed with by a cruel fate.

181
00:14:15.590 --> 00:14:16.910
But...

182
00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:21.180
you were always right.

183
00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:27.060
I said, "That doesn't mean people who 
are right will always be rewarded."

184
00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:28.340
But...

185
00:14:28.740 --> 00:14:32.340
I want those who are right to be rewarded.

186
00:14:33.080 --> 00:14:34.640
Vice Captain Nacht...

187
00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:39.310
I'll leave Gimodelo here.

188
00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:41.590
What?! Uh...

189
00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:44.560
We'll do everything we can 
until you can join us.

190
00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:47.520
So polish yourself up 
as much as you can...

191
00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:50.330
and come join us.

192
00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:52.780
Yes, sir!

193
00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:56.700
I'm gonna die if I get hit by that!

194
00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:59.070
Mister Nacht is an ogre!

195
00:15:00.800 --> 00:15:03.880
Pleasure working with ya, Gimodelo!

196
00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:08.270
Th-They're definitely out to kill me!

197
00:15:35.050 --> 00:15:37.600
Okay, let's go!

198
00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:41.880
Looks like you're all here. Are you ready?

199
00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:43.800
Crimson Lion Kings Captain
Fuegoleon Vermillion

200
00:15:42.310 --> 00:15:43.800
Where's Asta?

201
00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:46.380
Aqua Deer Captain
Rill Boismortier

202
00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:46.380
He's going to need a little more time.

203
00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:50.180
Green Praying Mantises Captain
Jack the Ripper

204
00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:50.180
Green Praying Mantises
Sekke Bronzazza

205
00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:50.180
Not like I'm counting on him anyway!

206
00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:52.930
Blue Rose Knights Captain
Charlotte Roselei

207
00:15:50.180 --> 00:15:52.930
Aw, Asta's not coming?

208
00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:58.020
Well, whatever. We're probably gonna 
see something super fun real soon!

209
00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:58.020
Sally

210
00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:58.020
Valtos

211
00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:58.020
Rades Spirito

212
00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:00.440
Maybe I'll get to test out the magic items

213
00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:00.440
Coral Peacocks Captain
Dorothy Unsworth

214
00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:03.360
I made from researching Asta's body!

215
00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:03.360
Golden Dawn
Langris Vaude

216
00:16:03.360 --> 00:16:07.650
Silver Eagles Captain
Nozel Silva

217
00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:07.650
I heard she made these robes. 
Are they actually safe?

218
00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:12.160
Makusa North

219
00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:13.100
Sally's a bit weird, but she's the best 
when it comes to magic item research!

220
00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:14.410
Ralph Niaflem

221
00:16:13.100 --> 00:16:14.410
Don't worry.

222
00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:18.250
Makusa! Don't butt in just because 
magic items were mentioned!

223
00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:20.470
Oh, look, Rades!

224
00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:24.380
You wouldn't believe it, but these robes 
have the ability to conceal magic!

225
00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:27.590
Just as Sally said, after 
researching Asta's anti-magic,

226
00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:29.910
we were able to create this amazing...

227
00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:30.990
Just shut up already!

228
00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:29.910
Magic is so deep.

229
00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:30.990
Good grief.

230
00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:33.140
Wh-Wh...

231
00:16:33.610 --> 00:16:37.010
Why do I have to participate in this 
insanely crazy demon-mode level mission

232
00:16:37.010 --> 00:16:39.770
surrounded by all these insane guys?!

233
00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:43.420
I mean, I did live it up 
these past six months, but...

234
00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:44.480
Bah-ha!

235
00:16:44.920 --> 00:16:51.290
Sekke! Show those captains 
just what you're made of!

236
00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:52.480
Bah-ha!

237
00:16:52.480 --> 00:16:56.790
No one told me we'd be 
going straight into hell!

238
00:16:57.040 --> 00:17:02.750
I don't know why the hell you're here, 
but you'd better give it your all.

239
00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:07.710
Sacrifice yourself for the righteous.

240
00:17:07.710 --> 00:17:09.300
What?!

241
00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:11.750
Will Asta really make it in time?

242
00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:13.170
He'll be here.

243
00:17:13.800 --> 00:17:17.560
Golden Dawn Vice Captain
Yuno

244
00:17:14.100 --> 00:17:17.560
Though I'll take care of 
everything before he shows up.

245
00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.560
Not you! That'll be me!

246
00:17:20.870 --> 00:17:22.560
Not you, either.

247
00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:25.130
Shadow Magic: Shadow Corridor.

248
00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:31.620
It'll be us.

249
00:17:37.870 --> 00:17:38.950
Oh?

250
00:17:39.180 --> 00:17:41.120
Looks like they're here.

251
00:17:41.690 --> 00:17:43.180
The resistance!

252
00:17:44.860 --> 00:17:48.300
Hear me, Dark Triad!

253
00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:51.840
Seventeen years ago, you 
murdered our king, King Loyce,

254
00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:53.800
and many of our brethren!

255
00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:58.310
And since then, you've committed 
heinous crimes against our citizens!

256
00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:01.090
You will pay for this!

257
00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:06.970
We know that if we fought 
you to the death, we'd lose.

258
00:18:06.970 --> 00:18:08.590
But even so...

259
00:18:09.670 --> 00:18:18.080
We, the citizens of the Spade Kingdom, 
will never accept you as our king!

260
00:18:20.830 --> 00:18:23.210
All right. Everyone, follow the plan.

261
00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:29.160
So you were undercover 
in the Spade Kingdom,

262
00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:33.010
and you'd been in contact with the 
resistance ever since I left the kingdom?

263
00:18:33.010 --> 00:18:37.860
Yes. I didn't intend to get so 
involved with the resistance.

264
00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:42.770
But seeing your abilities and actions, 
I thought it'd be better if I helped out.

265
00:18:43.230 --> 00:18:48.780
I saw your resolve at the meeting. 
Sorry I pretended I didn't know.

266
00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:50.260
You can't be serious.

267
00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:55.630
I implore you, Sir Nacht! 
The Clover Kingdom's greatest mages!

268
00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:57.700
And... Lord Yuno!

269
00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:02.200
We'll create a diversion for you 
even if it costs us our lives!

270
00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:09.900
What's this shaking?!

271
00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:21.430
That's...

272
00:19:21.430 --> 00:19:24.270
the legendary ancient demon?!

273
00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:27.920
When faced with overwhelming power,

274
00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:31.520
feelings and persistence mean nothing.

275
00:19:32.140 --> 00:19:34.780
Since a rat managed to sneak in,

276
00:19:35.310 --> 00:19:38.280
I figured the resistance 
would try something

277
00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:41.030
against the Qliphoth advent ritual...

278
00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:44.750
but I didn't expect them 
to come at us head-on.

279
00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:47.870
We were planning to use the demon to

280
00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:50.880
exterminate all the people 
in the castle town.

281
00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:55.880
You're not citizens of the Spade Kingdom.

282
00:19:56.320 --> 00:20:00.550
Only we, the strong, are 
citizens of the Spade Kingdom.

283
00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:04.080
Let the Qliphoth advent ritual begin.

284
00:20:07.820 --> 00:20:09.170
This sound...

285
00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:11.090
Such intense mana!

286
00:20:11.090 --> 00:20:13.150
Are the ones outside all right?!

287
00:20:13.340 --> 00:20:14.650
They're fine.

288
00:20:34.070 --> 00:20:36.760
Men! That was some good howling!

289
00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:42.340
I, Mereoleona Vermillion, a royal of the 
Clover Kingdom, will lend you a hand!

290
00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:50.530
The advent ritual is a giant magic circle 
that's powered by four functions.

291
00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:54.690
First is the site of the advent 
of Qliphoth in the center.

292
00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:59.530
The remaining three are the Dark 
Triad, who will activate the ritual.

293
00:21:00.520 --> 00:21:03.140
We'll defeat all three 
members of the Triad

294
00:21:03.140 --> 00:21:05.330
and make it so the ritual can't operate.

295
00:21:05.500 --> 00:21:08.420
Then the advent of the 
Qliphoth will be stopped,

296
00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:10.330
and we'll prevent the gate from opening.

297
00:21:10.590 --> 00:21:14.540
Another plan is to use anti-magic 
to destroy the Qliphoth itself.

298
00:21:14.540 --> 00:21:16.860
But it's not guaranteed to work.

299
00:21:17.550 --> 00:21:21.510
And if we did forcefully destroy 
it and Yami or Vangeance died,

300
00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:23.340
you all wouldn't forgive me, would you?

301
00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:27.160
The Triad is in three different spots 
on the perimeter of the magic circle.

302
00:21:27.660 --> 00:21:31.600
So we'll split into three groups, 
attack the Triad together, and crush them.

303
00:21:32.420 --> 00:21:34.610
Even if there's a diversion 
outside the castle,

304
00:21:34.610 --> 00:21:37.690
you'll probably run into 
some Dark Disciples.

305
00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:39.240
Intruders!

306
00:21:39.240 --> 00:21:43.450
When you do, someone can 
act as a decoy and go wild.

307
00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:49.700
To take them down for good,

308
00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:53.440
we'll send as many of us as 
we can to take out the Triad.

309
00:22:08.110 --> 00:22:10.860
This is the end, Dark Triad!

